  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: bash/shell-analysis cluster — this item (alias key duplication: bash + shell as separate top-level keys), INV-hokig (profile.languages vs analyzer-pass file-count disagreement, 10 vs 41), WI-pulor (bash analyzer lines_of_code=None + no intra-script call edges), and INV-tajap (entrypoint detection has no shebang/.sh logic at all) together describe hypergumbo's incomplete bash analysis surface. Fixing this item is the simplest of the four (single normalization in taxonomy.py:758-776) and partially clears WI-soraj's 3-file-count ambiguity. The other three are independent."  # ecae
